  "responses": {
    "200": {
      "schema": {
        "description_en": "The details of the provisionConfig configuration",
        "description_zh": "provisionConfig配置详情",
        "properties": {
          "alwaysAllocateCPU": {
            "description_en": "Indicates whether CPU is always allocated to function instances",
            "description_zh": "是否始终分配CPU给函数实例",
            "example": "true",
            "title_en": "是否始终分配CPU给函数实例。",
            "title_zh": "是否始终分配CPU给函数实例。",
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "current": {
            "description_en": "The actual number of resources",
            "description_zh": "实际资源个数",
            "example": "1",
            "format": "int64",
            "title_en": "实际资源个数",
            "title_zh": "实际资源个数",
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "resource": {
            "description_en": "The resource description",
            "description_zh": "资源描述",
            "example": "\"12345#servierName#qualifier#functionName\"",
            "title_en": "资源描述",
            "title_zh": "资源描述",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "scheduledActions": {
            "description_en": "The scheduled scaling policy configuration",
            "description_zh": "定时策略配置",
            "itemName": "scheduledAction",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ScheduledActions",
              "description_en": "The scheduled scaling policy. You can use scheduled scaling policies to flexibly configure provisioned function instances by setting the number of provisioned function instances to a desired value at a specified time. This allows the number of function instances to better match the concurrency of your workloads",
              "description_zh": "定时伸缩策略：通过定时伸缩策略您可以更加灵活地配置预留的函数实例，在指定时间将预留的函数实例量设定成需要的值，使函数实例量更好地贴合业务的并发量",
              "example": "[     {       \"Name\": \"action_1\",       \"StartTime\": \"2020-11-01T10:00:00Z\",       \"EndTime\": \"2020-11-30T10:00:00Z\",       \"TargetValue\": 50,       \"ScheduleExpression\": \"cron(0 0 20 * * *)\"     },     {       \"Name\": \"action_2\",       \"StartTime\": \"2020-11-01T10:00:00Z\",       \"EndTime\": \"2020-11-30T10:00:00Z\",       \"TargetValue\": 10,       \"ScheduleExpression\": \"cron(0 0 22 * * *)\"     }   ]"
            },
            "title_en": "定时策略配置",
            "title_zh": "定时策略配置",
            "type": "array"
          },
          "target": {
            "description_en": "The target number of resources",
            "description_zh": "目标资源个数",
            "example": "5",
            "format": "int64",
            "title_en": "目标资源个数",
            "title_zh": "目标资源个数",
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "targetTrackingPolicies": {
            "description_en": "The metric tracking scaling policy configuration",
            "description_zh": "指标追踪伸缩策略配置",
            "itemName": "targetTrackingPolicy",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TargetTrackingPolicies",
              "description_en": "The metric tracking scaling policy. This policy scales provisioned resources once per minute based on the concurrency utilization of function instances.\n\nWhen the metric exceeds the tracking value metricTarget, an aggressive scale-out policy is applied to increase the number of provisioned function instances so that the metric returns to near the metricTarget value.\nWhen the metric falls below the tracking value metricTarget, a conservative scale-in policy is applied to decrease the number of provisioned function instances so that the metric gradually returns to near the metricTarget value.\n\nIf you set a maximum value and a minimum value for scaling in the system, the number of provisioned function instances scales between the maximum and minimum values. Scale-out stops when the maximum value is exceeded, and scale-in stops when the number falls below the minimum value",
              "description_zh": "指标伸缩策略：根据函数实例并发利用率的情况每分钟对预留资源进行一次伸缩。\n\n当指标超过追踪值metricTarget时，开始以积极的策略扩容预留模式的函数实例量，以使得指标值恢复到追踪值metricTarget附近。\n当指标低于追踪值metricTarget时，开始以保守的策略缩容预留模式的函数实例量，以使得指标值逐渐恢复到追踪值metricTarget附近。\n\n当您在系统中设置了伸缩最大值和最小值时，预留的函数实例量会在最大值与最小值之间进行伸缩，超出最大值时将停止扩容，低于最小值时将停止缩容",
              "example": "[     {       \"Name\": \"action_1\",       \"StartTime\": \"2020-11-01T10:00:00Z\",       \"EndTime\": \"2020-11-30T10:00:00Z\",       \"MetricType\": \"ProvisionedConcurrencyUtilization\",       \"MetricTarget\": 0.6,       \"MinCapacity\": 10,       \"MaxCapacity\": 100,     }   ]"
            },
            "title_en": "指标追踪伸缩策略配置",
            "title_zh": "指标追踪伸缩策略配置",
            "type": "array"
          }
        },
        "title_en": "provisionConfigResponse",
        "title_zh": "provisionConfigResponse",
        "type": "object"
      }
    },
